invariant: INV-5
file: x509_ca.c
catches: x509strict
reason: a rejection that leaves earlier bytes in the caller's key array
  breaks the failure contract — x509_read_spki sets its outputs on some
  failing paths, so the entry's own wipe is what makes CH_EINVAL clean

--- old
    *key_len = 0;
    ct_wipe(key, CH_X509_KEY_MAX);
--- new
    *key_len = 0;
